        "name": "The Hitman and the Seer",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Aphelios wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister Alune. He has access to two at a time: one main-hand and one off-hand. Each weapon has a unique Basic Attack and Ability. Attacks and abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, Aphelios discards the weapon and Alune summons the next of the 5. ",
        "bodyHtml": "Aphelios wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister, Alune. He has access to two at a time: one main-hand and one off-hand. Each weapon has a unique Attack and Ability [?]. Attacks and Abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, Aphelios discards the weapon and Alune summons the next one. <br /><br />Aphelios unlocks his weapon's Ability [?] at level 2 and his Ultimate at level 6. Instead of powering up his Abilities, Aphelios' rank-ups grant him permanent stats.<br /><br /><span>Lunari Weapon Order:</span><span></span><span></span><span style=\"color: #424242\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>",
